  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Arrange the following metal complex/ compounds in the increasing order of spin only magnetic moment. Presume all the three, high spin system.</p><p>(Atomic numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ce</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>58</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Gd</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Eu</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn></math>.)</p><p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ce</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Gd</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and</p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Eu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p>"
